,"r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"Finally, we're on track to achieve full-year cost savings expected from our new zero-based budgeting process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"R 2018 Q3","e":"r","d":"2018-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"…operating leverage on our current maintenance facility network as we grow, lowering maintenance cost through fleet turnover and initiatives, improving used vehicle sales results, expanding non-asset-based earnings, and continuing cost reduction opportunities to drive ROC to the target range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"R 2018 Q4","e":"r","d":"2019-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Art A. Garcia","x":"Reflecting modest market price increases and the younger age of units sold.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"R 2018 Q4","e":"r","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"…in-cab cameras technologies, resulting in better safety performance, Ryder guide providing our customers with access to a suite of fleet management activities from a mobile device, and smart warehousing capabilities to improve productivity and drive cost savings for our supply chain customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"R 2018 Q4","e":"r","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"Lastly, we successfully implemented a new zero-based budgeting process, which drove significant cost saving in 2018 and which will continue to leverage to achieve further savings in the years ahead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q1","e":"r","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"Finally, we are on track to achieve our full-year cost savings expected from our multi-year maintenance cost reduction initiative and from our zero-based budgeting process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q1","e":"r","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"J. Steven Sensing","x":"They've got cost cutting initiatives in there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q2","e":"r","d":"2019-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"…components, there is the Ryder Last Mile, which is the big and bulky home delivery business, and then there is the e-commerce fulfillment initiative, which is really getting after more parcel type business targeting companies that want to go direct to consumer without going through an e-retailer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q2","e":"r","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Brunn","x":"Finally, we're on track to achieve the full-year cost savings expected from our multi-year maintenance cost reduction initiative and expect additional opportunities to lower costs and drive efficiencies in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q2","e":"r","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"I think, look, cost reduction, we talked about the maintenance cost initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q3","e":"r","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"And then on our ongoing initiatives to improve ROC whether it's pruning accounts or continuing to raise prices that's going to continue -- that's going to put a little bit of headwind on it also.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q3","e":"r","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"We remain focused on our core -- on our cost structure and are encouraged by our cost savings initiatives that are ahead of plan -- that are on or ahead of plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q3","e":"r","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"The most significant of these initiatives is the multi-year $75 million annual maintenance cost savings initiative we announced earlier this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q3","e":"r","d":"2019-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"This triggered a review and lowering of residual value estimates on power vehicles which is intended to reflect this downturn and our lowered outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q4","e":"r","d":"2020-02-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"We're continuing to implement meaningful ChoiceLease price increases in order to raise returns and derisk the business in light of the volatility of the used truck market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q4","e":"r","d":"2020-02-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Parker","x":"The price increases we're implementing, how that impacts that, David.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q4","e":"r","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"We are on track to substantially rightsize the rental fleet by the end of the first quarter, but we'll continue to make more modest sequential reductions for the balance of the year in order to align the fleet with market conditions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2019 Q4","e":"r","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"We expect continued benefits from our multiyear maintenance cost savings initiative and are increasing the total expected annual savings from $75 million to $100 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q1","e":"r","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"We're continuing to implement meaningful ChoiceLease price increases in order to raise returns and de-risk the business in light of the volatility of the used truck market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q1","e":"r","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"Revenue per unit for new leased vehicles is up by mid-single digits compared to new leased vehicles in the prior year as a result of price increases in 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q1","e":"r","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Diez","x":"We are going to continue to right-size our fleet through the balance of the year and hopefully gain some incremental margin from those actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q1","e":"r","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Kauffman","x":"What do you think -- understanding that this is an unusual trough and we probably finished the year in a better place than second quarter, what do you believe the right size of the rental fleet is relative to the full-service lease fleet?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q2","e":"r","d":"2020-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"I think the move between the tariff awards last year and this issue with COVID, I think the on-shoring and near-shoring activity is going to increase, and Ryder is really focused primarily in North America.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q2","e":"r","d":"2020-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"These initiatives include ChoiceLease price increases resulting in mid-single-digit improvement in revenue per new lease unit compared to the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q2","e":"r","d":"2020-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"And over time, could lead to price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q2","e":"r","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Brunn","x":"…negatively impacted results by approximately $45 million, driven by $55 million from lower residual from lower rental demand and $25 million from reduced automotive customer activity and supply chain, partially offset by COVID-19-related cost savings and lower medical costs totaling $35 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q2","e":"r","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Brunn","x":"These were partially offset by COVID-related cost savings actions and lower medical costs totaling $20 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q2","e":"r","d":"2020-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"We've increased our outlook for expected pre-tax earnings as a percent of operating revenue to the high single-digit range for this business, in line with our long-term profitability target for the overall supply chain business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"R 2020 Q3","e":"r","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott T. Parker","x":"As you may recall, on the second quarter call, we provided a sensitivity noting that a 30% price increase for tractors and a 10% price increase for trucks in the U.S. was needed by 2022 in order to maintain our current policy depreciation residual estimate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2020 Q3","e":"r","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Todd Fowler","x":"In the past, the policy depreciation adjustment, it seemed like it was something that was done more annually, now you kind of had this 2-year bogey out with a 30% price increase from where you were in the middle of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2020 Q3","e":"r","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott T. Parker","x":"Higher pricing on leased vehicles and lower maintenance costs, including benefits from our cost savings initiatives, also contributed to earnings improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2020 Q3","e":"r","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"The remaining improvement needed to reach our ROE target is expected to come primarily from initiatives that include lease pricing increases, cost actions, including our multiyear maintenance cost savings initiative and accelerated growth in our supply chain and dedicated businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2020 Q4","e":"r","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Parker","x":"We're encouraged by the continued improvement in the used vehicle market conditions with double-digit price increases for both tractors and trucks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2020 Q4","e":"r","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Parker","x":"On the second quarter call, we provided the sensitivity, noting that a 10% price increase for trucks and a 30% price increase for tractors in the U.S. is needed by 2022 in order to maintain our current policy depreciation residual estimates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2020 Q4","e":"r","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Parker","x":"Rental results benefited from lower maintenance costs, including benefits from our cost savings initiative and earlier actions taken to align the fleet with lower demand due to COVID and higher pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2020 Q4","e":"r","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Parker","x":"Rental demand recovery and initiatives, including maintenance cost savings, are also expected to contribute to higher returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/ryder-system-inc-r-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q1","e":"r","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Parker","x":"We're very encouraged by the continued improvement in used vehicle market conditions resulting in double-digit price increases for both tractors and trucks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q1","e":"r","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"In addition, we saw strong sales activity across all three business segments, and our multiyear maintenance cost savings initiative remains on track for this year's targeted savings of $30 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q1","e":"r","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Parker","x":"Results also benefited from lower maintenance costs, including benefits from our maintenance cost savings initiative as well as lower bad debt expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q1","e":"r","d":"2021-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Stephanie Benjamin","x":"It appears you didn't give a new outlook on top-line expectations, and it sounds like primarily the increased guidance is due to FMS performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q2","e":"r","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John J. Diez","x":"As you may recall, in the second quarter of last year, we provided a sensitivity noting that a 10% price increase for trucks and a 30% price increase for tractors in the U.S. would be needed by 2022 in order to maintain current policy depreciation residual estimates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q2","e":"r","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"You saw the pricing power that we have and how much pricing has gone up, 13%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/ryder-system-inc-r-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q3","e":"r","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John J. Diez","x":"As you may recall, last year, we provided a sensitivity noting that a 10% price increase for trucks and a 30% price increase for tractors in the U.S. would be needed by 2022 in order to maintain current residual value estimates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2021 Q3","e":"r","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"Supply chain and dedicated margins are expected to improve in the first half of next year and move toward the target range in the second half, reflecting price increases to address higher labor costs, barring any further market disruptions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/ryder-system-inc-r-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"R 2025 Q2","e":"r","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"I think there's still certainly lingering uncertainty around tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/ryder-r-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2025 Q2","e":"r","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Sanchez","x":"But we still have, I think, a lot of uncertainty tied to still some of the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/ryder-r-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2025 Q2","e":"r","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christyne McGarvey","x":"So what you're seeing here is, you know, the trucks regardless, if you look at retail activity, did have a sequential price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/ryder-r-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2025 Q2","e":"r","d":"2025-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christyne McGarvey","x":"Higher ChoiceLease performance driven by pricing and maintenance cost savings initiatives partially offset lower used vehicle sales results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/ryder-r-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2025 Q2","e":"r","d":"2025-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Diez","x":"We expect $50 million in benefits over multiple years from our maintenance cost savings initiative announced in mid-2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/ryder-r-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2025 Q4","e":"r","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"Our multiyear lease pricing and initial maintenance cost savings initiatives meaningfully contributed to increasing our return profile by delivering a combined annual pretax earnings benefit of over $225 million and also contributing to positive free cash flow over the cycle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/ryder-system-r-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2025 Q4","e":"r","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Sanchez","x":"We are expecting another $50 million in benefits from the next phase of our maintenance cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/ryder-system-r-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2026 Q1","e":"r","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Diez","x":"Obviously, with used vehicles, we do expect, and we haven't seen yet what the OEM's price increase will look like.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ryder-r-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2026 Q1","e":"r","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Diez","x":"We do think that price increase will be meaningful, certainly in that 10% to 15% range at a minimum, which will provide some support for used vehicle sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ryder-r-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2026 Q1","e":"r","d":"2026-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Diez","x":"Our multiyear lease pricing and maintenance cost savings initiatives continue to contribute meaningfully to our increased return profile and positive free cash flow over the cycle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ryder-r-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2026 Q1","e":"r","d":"2026-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Diez","x":"In Fleet Management, we expect our multiyear lease pricing and maintenance cost savings initiatives to benefit 2026 results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ryder-r-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2026 Q1","e":"r","d":"2026-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Diez","x":"I'll then review our raised outlook for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ryder-r-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"R 2026 Q3","e":"r","d":"2026-10-22","l":"pricing_powe